                                                "sense_id": "aa78d1a9-7844-3bf1-85d5-085f9119b5b3",
                                                "text": "At a minimum, a textual (command-line) system requires 256 mebibytes of RAM and a graphical (desktop) system requires 384-512 mebibytes of RAM."
